        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/azqa/{size}/2015_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-12-04T14:19:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I haven't done any multiplayer on Steam, so this is just going off a 2-second Google search - I see that Steam has voice chat capability, but I don't know how convenient that is to use. &nbsp;Is it something that can be easily set up for a given match? &nbsp;If not, is that a capability that can be added in some future expansion of the game?</p>",
