        "id": 151189,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-12-04T16:17:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Steam VOIP is OK, it's only really useable if the people you are playing with are on your friends list though. So a private game with people from the Forum could be done that way but a general game wouldn't work.</p><p>Given there are already whole programs devoted to running VOIP I'm not sure how much a SotM:VG specific thing added in would get used for the extra time and effort it would take to program/make cross compatible.</p>",
