        "created_at": "2015-12-05T00:54:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We totally need to do a \"Class of Skype '12\" game at some point with VOIP  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"></p>\n<p>Anyone remember those very first games on Skype chat? We had some epic roleplaying in some of those!</p>",
