      {
        "id": 151194,
        "name": "Chaosmancer",
        "username": "Chaosmancer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-12-05T15:48:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've got two things.</p>\n<p>One, I've often clicked suggestion because I forget I'm playing multiplayer instead of a single game. So I'm attempting to play cards and not suggest.</p>\n<p>Two, typing on the kindle tablet for chat is a pain in the butt, same withactually playing cards some times. Of course, sometimes the delay is me agonizing over a choice, because I do know the game fairly well and I'm a person who can easily suffer from option paralysis.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Then again, despite only playing a few times I've seen some wierd stuff. I had one guy playing Bunker, I can't remeber who against, but we lost and the Bunker playing literally did nothing except draw cards. I don't think he played more than 3 cards the entire game and initialized every turn. Then commented Bunker was \"the worst deck\". I was so angry I played Bunker in the follow up game to show him what was what, though I didn't tell him that's why I did it.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>P.S. When I read the title I thought you were going to complain that Handelabra was avoiding you and I was going to ask what you did to upset them.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=9\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"></p>",
